From ca663706e9bf21ba4b27511049b659539799eab2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 09:17:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(kanban): re-check standing human asks each dispatcher
 tick [daveey]

sweep_agent_owned_blocks skips blocks that carry a human_request, and the ask
lint runs only when an agent files the block, so a standing ask was never
looked at again: on 10-30 11 of 25 hub asks were void.

sweep_standing_asks (same tick) moves a blocked card with a human_request and
no live run to agent triage, with an ask_rechecked event (code, reason, old
ask), when (a) agent_relay_ask_error / agent_route_gap_error refuses it today,
or (b) it names at least one card on this board and all are done/archived.
Once per block event; an ask re-filed unchanged after a recheck stands.

_RELAY also matches 'from an owner (Hermes) chat', 'from any owner chat' and
'from an owner Hermes Desktop or CLI chat' (hub t_01a1848506cae619).
ask_rechecked counts as agent triage in kanban_wait_info.
---
